The conceptual outline of FORGE has been illustrated in Fig. 1a, while the overall study design, including data preprocessing and analysis, is presented in Supplementary Fig. 1, while the cancer types among the DepMap and CREAMMIST datasets are illustrated in Supplementary Fig. 2a, b. The dataset dimensions and other descriptions were outlined in Table 1. FORGE takes high-dimensional baseline gene expression data G as input and projects it into a compressed, biologically meaningful latent space through a sparse gene embedding matrix \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
