We then assumed a typical RNA-seq depth of approximately 35 × 106 mapped fragments, and effective gene length as Li − 199, where Li is the full gene length and 199 bp approximates the average length of 75-100 bp paired-end sequencing fragments. Further simplification yields: 3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
